# Claude circles archive

> A Claude conversation archive on the circles thread.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as a saved conversation shelf named circles. Source: fitzyracing1/claude-circles.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the chat history in this repo.
2. Use it to recall that thread.
3. Do not treat the archive as the only product file.

## Key ideas
- Conversation archive
- Circles thread
- Family of claude-* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-circles
archive = conversation_shelf("circles")
read(archive)
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. conversation_shelf("circles") → “this folder holds that thread”
2. read(archive) → “open the saved talk”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the chat → stay here

## What a person would notice
A boxed conversation under the circles name.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the archive.
